    "profile_title": "A1 Mini Expanded Improved Profile for SBBS",
    "profile_notes": "SteelBall Battleship is fully blown out for the A1 Mini in this Profile. Default Settings A1 Mini .4mm PLA Basic (any) Changes from the original include: Thicker Sea Bars don't sag and are easier to glue together at the center. Modified Carrier Target Sections to accommodate the thicker Sea Bars. Other ships not affected. Sea Bars are easier to glue together at the center. Changed the “Trunks” or “Gutters” geometry slightly to make them stronger at the gluing points and easier to glue together at the center. Also, lowered the front edge of the Gutters so balls and targets actually go in them! Added Side Rails to keep balls on the base board (you provide this a base board). Added Custom Storage Boxes to fit all game parts in the corners of a base board (you provide this a base board). Included 7mm x 4.5 mm discs to use as Magnet Stands to mount 6x3mm Disc Magnet closures to the Storage Boxes. Added Tweezers to help with picking up and setting Targets on the Sea Bars. Made a cool video to demonstrate:",
